{
  "id": "feature:barbarian/path-of-the-berserker/frenzy",
  "name": "Frenzy",
  "source": {
    "book": "srd"
  },
  "text": {
    "formatted": "Starting when you choose this path at 3rd level, you can go into a frenzy when you rage. If you do so, for the duration of your rage you can make a single melee weapon attack as a bonus action on each of your turns after this one. When your rage ends, you suffer one level of Exhaustion (as described in appendix PH-A).",
    "plain": "Starting when you choose this path at 3rd level, you can go into a frenzy when you rage. If you do so, for the duration of your rage you can make a single melee weapon attack as a bonus action on each of your turns after this one. When your rage ends, you suffer one level of Exhaustion (as described in appendix PH-A).",
    "wording": "srd"
  },
